BEWARE! the scroll you are reading might be cursed in which case some
of the monsters you try to genocide will be sent in.
in case i know it is an uncursed one I'd either wipe out black dragons
(so I won't have to care too much about having reflection against
their disintegration blasts) or gremlins (they might steal intrinsics
from you) or titans (they can curse some of your items and use finger
of death). otherwise I'd chose gelatinous cubes or quivering blobs
(they're pretty much the same) because they might paralyze you if you
happen to run into one; on the other hand they are rather slow, so you
can kill them safely from a distance and gain intrinsics by eating
them (they're acidic, so take care).
the best class to genocide are L(iches). they're a pain in the ass for
cursing your items and Gehennom is full of them.


